<title>UK: Weir Group says Q1 profit ahead of year-ago.</title>
<headline>Weir Group says Q1 profit ahead of year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering firm Weir Group Plc said on Wednesday its first-quarter profits were ahead of the year-ago period and in line with its budget.</p>
</text>
